# Proactive Code Edits

When the user request is clear and actionable, proceed directly with code changes without asking for extra confirmation.

## Default Behavior

- Start implementation immediately after understanding the task.
- Avoid unnecessary confirmation questions before editing files.
- Group related edits and complete the requested change in one pass when possible.

## Required Exceptions

- Ask for confirmation before destructive or irreversible actions.
- Ask for clarification when requirements are ambiguous or conflicting.
- Follow higher-priority safety and system constraints at all times.
